{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI在11月18日發佈了最新的技術報告，裏面披露了一個相當有意思的進展：他們的大模型已經深度參與到AMD的晶片設計流程中，在這家晶片廠旗艦GPU的電路設計上拿到了最高14%的PPA提升。<strong>而且部分AI生成的優化，已經進了近期送廠製造的晶片設計。按照OpenAI的説法，這次合作相當於把大約一年的工程優化工作壓縮到了不到5個月。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587388.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.199912+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T10:00:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_hash":"8f157e1c8ca42a98f8bace91ff3dd28d6043d49c014b343005e38e55e9c86e21","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}